@startuml format-lifecycle
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

state "draft\n(on a branch)" as draft
state "active\n(on main)" as active
state "deprecated\n(stays in the document)" as deprecated

[*] --> draft : write with the next free number
draft --> active : merge the pull request
active --> active : edit the text (same ID)
active --> deprecated : write the status "廃止"
note right of deprecated
  The number is never used again.
  A replacement gets a new ID.
end note
@enduml
